             run_int_0RB____0LC1RD_1RB1LC_0LD0RB (Ap_Alph_10_11_11 q0 ++ [S0]) [] j
             ltac:(discriminate) ltac:(reflexivity)).
  f_equal. exact (gei_0RB____0LC1RD_1RB1LC_0LD0RB p j q0 E).
